WEBVTT

47:33.043 --> 47:34.962
"He belongs to me now."

47:38.715 --> 47:40.759
How did he get so fat?

47:40.884 --> 47:45.180
He only stops eating
when it's time for a drink. (CHUCKLES)

47:45.305 --> 47:46.682
(KNOCKING)

47:46.807 --> 47:49.226
MAN: It's Maester Luwin, my lord.

47:50.686 --> 47:52.604
Send him in.

47:54.898 --> 47:57.234
Pardon, my lord, my lady.

47:57.359 --> 47:59.862
A rider in the night...

47:59.987 --> 48:02.156
from your sister.
